Release Check
    area
    try
    expected
    - C01 A Percent Is A Share
        area: numbers
        try: turn formulas on and leave the discount cell in Deal below
        expected: the net of Acme is $70,000 and of Kite €17,000
    - C02 A Column Takes Its Unit Through Its Alias
        area: units
        try: hover the km in Trip's distance (km) heading
        expected: it says Unit, Length, km, and that 1 km is 1000 m; a formula reads 120 as 120 km
    - C03 A Cell's Own Unit Wins
        area: units
        try: look at the speed of B in Trip below
        expected: 75 mi over 1 h is 120.7008 in the column's km/h
    - C04 A Unit Alone Chooses The Cell's
        area: units
        try: clear the number in front of the mile total in Trip Summary, leaving mi, and leave the line
        expected: the total comes back in miles
    - C05 A Wrong Kind Is An Error
        area: units
        try: write 5 kg in front of the formula on total in Trip Summary
        expected: the line says the formula gives km and this cell says kg, and the cell keeps what it said
    - C06 A Plain Number Needs The Unit
        area: units
        try: change the formula on total in Trip Summary to add 5
        expected: it says to write the unit on 5, as in 5 km; adding 5 km works
    - C07 The CSV Stays A Number
        area: units
        try: save, and open aot.files/Trip.csv in a spreadsheet
        expected: the heading says distance (km), and 120 is a number the spreadsheet sums
    - C08 A Roll-Up Counts Every Kind
        area: inheritance
        try: look at total net in Deal Summary
        expected: $87,000, the rows of both kinds, and by kind names each
    - C09 A Default Reads From Any Kind Above
        area: inheritance
        try: look at the limit of Deep below
        expected: it reads the 100 two levels up
    - C10 A Replaced Value Says So
        area: checks
        try: type 99999 over the net of Kite and leave the cell
        expected: net goes back to €17,000, and a warning stays on the cell until you edit it or close the file
    - C11 The Status Bar Adds It Up
        area: checks
        try: make a discount break its rule, then turn formulas off
        expected: the status bar counts the problem though V is 0, then says formulas not calculated
    - C12 Text Refuses Arithmetic
        area: numbers
        try: type n/a over the list price of Acme and leave the cell
        expected: the net says n/a is text, so it can't be multiplied, and keeps its value
    - C13 The Check That Can Fail
        area: checks
        try: in a terminal, run node check.js on this file, then type a wrong number in front of a formula and run it again
        expected: 0 problems and exit 0, then that number, what its formula gives, and exit 1
    - C14 Verify Runs Nothing
        area: checks
        try: in a terminal, run node verify.js on this file
        expected: it verifies, then says how many formulas and rules it did not calculate

Deal
    discount <=@max discount
    net =@list price*(1-@discount)
    ... more kinds to come
    Enterprise Deal
        max discount: 35%
        Enterprise Deal|list price|discount|net
        Acme           |$100,000  |30%     |$70,000
    Standard Deal
        max discount: 20%
        Standard Deal|list price|discount|net
        Kite         |€20,000   |15%     |€17,000

Deal Summary
    enterprise net: $70,000 =@Enterprise Deal@net.sum()
    rows: 2 =len(@Deal)

Trip|distance (km)|time (h)|speed (km/h) =@distance/@time
A   |120          |1.5     |80
B   |75 mi        |1       |120.7008

Trip Summary
    total: 240.7008 km =@Trip@distance.sum()
    mile total: 149.56454306848008 mi =@Trip@distance.sum()

